{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-3-12","kind":"proposition","title":"外切两圆的圆心与切点共线","englishTitle":"If two circles touch one another externally, the straight line joining their centres will pass through the point of contact.","book":3,"number":12,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.12","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.12/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":12,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷三"}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-3-12@raw-60776a8bf0f026d6","contentId":"euclid-3-12","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"60776a8bf0f026d6996fb52cc8001428e45ceed72a5965749ed229fa4edc703e","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-3-12.statement","euclid-3-12.construction.1","euclid-3-12.proof.1","euclid-3-12.proof.2","euclid-3-12.proof.3","euclid-3-12.proof.4","euclid-3-12.proof.5","euclid-3-12.conclusion","euclid-3-12.historical.1","euclid-3-12.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-3-12.statement","contentId":"euclid-3-12","revisionId":"euclid-3-12@raw-60776a8bf0f026d6","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"25a82553c0729d8fc565faa7d7a69af283385b3a1a91754d2bf7b4f76107da8a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If two circles touch one another externally, the straight line joining their centres will pass through the point of contact."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果两个圆圈相互接触,连接其中心的直线将通过接触点。"},{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"两圜外相切以直线联两心必过切界"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"两圆外相切以直线联两心必过切界"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-12.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-3-12","revisionId":"euclid-3-12@raw-60776a8bf0f026d6","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"bac569896ddc74005f1332cb8c934cb83644642c5f905cf994e343ff6170b2fe","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let the two circles ABC, ADE touch one another externally at the point A, and let the centre F of ABC, and the centre G of ADE, be taken; I say that the straight line joined from F to G will pass through the point of contact at A."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让这两圈ABC,ADE在A点相互接触,让ABC点的中心F和ADE点的中心G被取走;我说,连接F至G的直线将在A点通过接触点。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-12.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-3-12","revisionId":"euclid-3-12@raw-60776a8bf0f026d6","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6f7362903a45a0119e11897bfecb775a8cf9550570a200329751718f6ae9a427","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For suppose it does not, but, if possible, let it pass as FCDG, and let AF, AG be joined."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"假设它不会,但如果可能,让它通过FCDG,让AF,AG连接。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-12.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-3-12","revisionId":"euclid-3-12@raw-60776a8bf0f026d6","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d00b4648689f32523acb244353492e0d2bf2aee845a002153d6230b4f2318e07","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then, since the point F is the centre of the circle ABC, FA is equal to FC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"F点是ABC点的中心,FA等于FC点。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-12.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-3-12","revisionId":"euclid-3-12@raw-60776a8bf0f026d6","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"570cfd2e9e64524756a230358c359c4b5ca1cef8ab5d82eb301eeb4f68a47774","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Again, since the point G is the centre of the circle ADE, GA is equal to GD."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,由于G点是ADE点的中心,GA点等于GD点。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-12.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-3-12","revisionId":"euclid-3-12@raw-60776a8bf0f026d6","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0567c64aa5d650f994b71b48fa30b4026432ebd66cbfbd7a0dd28008c25804cd","citations":["euclid-1-20"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But FA was also proved equal to FC; therefore FA, AG are equal to FC, GD, so that the whole FG is greater than FA, AG; but it is also less [[I. 20](/principles/euclid-1-20)]: which is impossible."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但FA也证明等于FC;因此,FA,AG等于FC,GD,因此,整个FG大于FA,AG;但情况也更少:这是不可能做到的。 [[I. 20](/principles/euclid-1-20)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-12.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-3-12","revisionId":"euclid-3-12@raw-60776a8bf0f026d6","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6ebdb09bece04ce6b9d0db57213845ba2b06b9ee4e0fb2e409e5b8c89b6261c0","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the straight line joined from F to G will not fail to pass through the point of contact at A; therefore it will pass through it."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,连接F至G的直线在A时不会穿过联络点,因此会通过。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-12.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-3-12","revisionId":"euclid-3-12@raw-60776a8bf0f026d6","order":7,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"01ffb246f71c858c0aa873588bc1812f2094da18f5294ff1c7a6af82dbacd1e6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc. Q. E. D.]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,等等Q.E.D。 ]"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-12.historical.1","contentId":"euclid-3-12","revisionId":"euclid-3-12@raw-60776a8bf0f026d6","order":8,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8f8bedc55b7464189aa657dd51cc4a7aa20e4e10915f27771bc6d464f552c403","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"两圜外相切以直线联两心必过切界解曰甲乙丙丁乙戊两圜外相切于乙其甲乙丙心为己丁乙戊心为庚题言作己庚直线必过乙论曰如云不然而己庚线截两圜界于戊于丙令于切界作乙己乙庚两线其乙己庚角形之己乙乙庚两边并大于己庚一边而乙庚与庚戊乙己与己丙俱同心所出线宜各等即庚戊丙己两线并亦大于庚己一线矣〈一卷二十〉夫庚己线分为庚戊丙己尚馀丙戊而云庚戊丙己大于庚己则分大于全也故直线聨己庚必过乙"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"两个圆外的切线解释如下：甲乙丙丁乙戊 切于 乙，甲乙丙 以 己丁乙戊 为中心，中心 庚。命题解释：直线 己庚 必须经过 乙。证明如下：如果不这样，己庚 直线将与圆周在 戊 和 丙 相交。让 乙己乙庚 直线在切线边界处画出。乙己庚 三角形 己乙乙庚 的两边都大于 己庚，而 乙庚、庚戊乙己 和 己丙 都是同心的。外出的 庚戊丙己 直线应等于 庚己。〈一卷二十〉 和 庚己 被分成 庚戊丙己，留下 丙戊，如果 庚戊丙己 大于 庚己，则该直线必须通过 乙。"}]},{"id":"euclid-3-12.source","contentId":"euclid-3-12","revisionId":"euclid-3-12@raw-60776a8bf0f026d6","order":9,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"462c82026f4c3b9b01efc4fe76ddb9d2c0d03a64b6aec3e618cd68543d61ab1c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.12/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.12\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)\nHistorical Chinese source: https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷三"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-3-12:euclid-1-20:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-3-12","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-3-12.proof.4"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-20","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.12","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:3.prop.12/","sourceLabel":"I. 20"}}],"incomingEdges":[],"dependencies":[{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-3-12:euclid-1-20:explicit","id":"euclid-1-20","book":1,"number":20,"kind":"proposition","title":"三角不等式：两边之和大于第三边","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"}],"dependents":[],"visualization":{"level":"concept_illustration","rendererId":"concept-circle","rationale":"The current renderer is selected by a broad geometry family and must not be presented as this proposition’s exact construction."},"sourceIssues":[]}
